  "details": "Please whitelist the CinemachinePathBase methods, such as FindClosestPoint, EvaluatePosition, EvaluatePositionAtUnit, EvaluateOrientation etc. For whatever reason, the type itself is exposed but none of its methods are. Cinemachine paths are completely unscriptable.\nI would like to use these instead of implementing my own bezier curves (which will probably be too slow) and I cannot think of any reason why none of it is whitelisted.",
